# Generated artefacts. Marking them -merge stops git attempting a line-by-line
# merge and littering the JSON with conflict markers when the daily bot and a
# local run both touch them; you resolve by picking a side and regenerating with
#   python3 -m engine.run --no-refresh
# linguist-generated keeps them out of the language stats and collapses them in
# GitHub diffs.
docs/data/*.json   -merge -diff linguist-generated=true
data/cache/*.csv   -merge -diff linguist-generated=true
